1
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,760
YUMBOO!!!

2
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:08,690
YUMBU!!

3
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,260
Yu-Gi-Oh!

4
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,240
Joey, she's not waking up. My.

5
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,700
She can't hear you.

6
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:11,477
Merrick trapped her mind
in the Shadow Realm.

7
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:12,390
Poor mine.

8
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:14,617
This tournament's gotten way out of hand.

9
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:15,680
You know why?

10
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:18,825
Because there's a
mind-warping psycho on board?

11
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,300
Just being honest.

12
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:22,810
Hey, you guys.

13
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:27,437
Why don't you all go to the next duel and
I'll stay here and keep an eye on mine?

14
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:30,637
I'll be okay, and besides,
we don't all need to be here.

15
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:31,550
Hold on.

16
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:33,080
Look, I'm fine.

17
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:37,535
And besides, the next duel of the
finals is about to start, so go watch.

18
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:40,537
If Mai were all right,
she'd say the same thing.

19
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:43,149
Now you go out there
and be strong for Mai,

20
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:45,869
and I'll sit by her
side till you get back.

21
00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:47,050
You sure?

22
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:50,380
I've never been more
sure than I am right now.

23
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:55,473
Everyone here has taught me so much
about being brave and facing my fears,

24
00:01:55,740 --> 00:01:56,780
including Mai.

25
00:01:56,960 --> 00:02:00,666
The way she stood up to Merrick
in that duel was so incredible.

26
00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:02,637
You guys are all so strong,

27
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:07,180
and the way you support each other
and support me is amazing. Thank you.

28
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:11,800
But now it's my turn to help out, and
I can start by being here for mine.

29
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:15,537
It's the least I can do, and it's
really important to me, guys.

30
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:16,450
What do you say?

31
00:02:16,533 --> 00:02:17,363
Well, all right.

32
00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:18,480
Nicely said.

33
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:20,370
All right.

34
00:02:20,453 --> 00:02:21,714
You convinced me, sis.

35
00:02:21,900 --> 00:02:22,980
Just be careful.

36
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,600
As soon as the Eighth Duelist arrives,

37
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,777
