45
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,920
So far, so good.

46
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:52,097
The Winged Dragon of Ra has been successfully
scammed into the Kaiba Corp mainframe.

47
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:55,477
Our network is translating
the Egyptian text on the card.

48
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,717
We should be able to
decipher its meaning and

49
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:00,682
find out all the secrets
of this card in no time.

50
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:01,770
Okay.

51
00:03:01,853 --> 00:03:03,937
Contact me as soon as you get the results.

52
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:04,850
Cool.

53
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:08,317
If duelist number eight does not
arrive in the next five minutes,

54
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:11,900
