be awarded to Seto Kaiba.

55
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:14,500
Kaiba, I must speak to you right away.

56
00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:15,840
Save it, Yugi.

57
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:17,730
Kaiba?

58
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,637
Yugi, let me guess.

59
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:23,797
You want to request an emergency landing
to get your friend to a hospital.

60
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,040
You can forget it.

61
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:29,397
I told you already when your friend
Bakura couldn't deal with his injury.

62
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:32,180
My tournament stops for no one. Got it?

63
00:03:32,540 --> 00:03:35,220
Kaiba, the guy's got a
heart of gold, right?

64
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:39,480
Yeah, his cheeks must hurt
from smiling so much. Well, Mr.

65
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:43,477
Sunshine's gonna advance to the next
round if his opponent doesn't show.

66
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,457
Marek, soon your winged
dragon will be in my deck.

67
00:03:46,540 --> 00:03:52,720
It looks like my competition came to
his senses and decided to back out.

68
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:56,720
Winning this duel was even
easier than I thought.

69
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,960
