73
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,897
Sato Kaiba will face...

74
00:04:13,980 --> 00:04:15,540
He will face...

75
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:21,880
You've got some nerve
showing up late to duel me.

76
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:23,281
Were you scared?

77
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:25,957
Did the thought of facing
a duelist as superior

78
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:29,220
