80
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:35,160
Let's begin.

81
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,080
Tell me, what's your name?

82
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:39,140
You may call me Ishizu.

83
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,280
Ishizu Ishtar.

84
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,440
Sister, help me!

85
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:46,740
Stay out of my way, you fool!

86
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:50,697
Yugi, she's the woman that you
and I met at the Egyptian exhibit!

87
00:04:50,780 --> 00:04:51,610
You're right.

88
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:53,520
Hello, my pharaoh.

89
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:55,120
Who are you?

90
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,040
I am Ishizu,

91
00:04:57,160 --> 00:05:00,777
and I have uncovered many
mysteries about you and these

92
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:04,520
ancient carvings using the
magic of my Millennium Necklace.

93
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:08,560
