Only Merrick, he turned against us, and
the evil within him is even stronger now.

100
00:05:31,340 --> 00:05:33,240
He is my brother. Oh, boy.

101
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:36,020
One Ishtar was bad enough. Who needs two?

102
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:38,177
She can't be any worse than Merrick.

103
