114
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:10,640
I don't believe in that
nonsense, is that clear?

115
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,680
And as for this duel,

116
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:15,937
just because you were foolish
enough to hand me Obelisk the

117
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:19,667
Tormentor doesn't mean that I
won't use it to destroy you now.

118
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:25,000
And I don't appreciate you using my tournament
to solve your personal family issues.

119
00:06:25,340 --> 00:06:27,680
I planned this with one goal in mind,

120
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:32,460
to reclaim my place as the
number one duelist in the world.

121
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:35,897
Have you forgotten that it was my idea for

122
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:38,177
you to organize the
Battle City Tournament?

123
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:41,960
To lure duelists like Merrick. Say, what?

124
00:06:42,260 --> 00:06:45,020
And my plan worked,
for my brother is here.

125
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:47,360
But the hardest task is yet to come.

126
00:06:47,540 --> 00:06:50,160
The evil within him must be stopped.

127
00:06:50,540 --> 00:06:54,517
And this mission can only be accomplished
with the help of the great pharaoh,

128
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:58,037
which is precisely why Yugi needed
to enter this tournament as well.

129
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:02,240
For this ancient pharaoh dwells
within Yugi's Millennium Puzzle.

130
00:07:02,460 --> 00:07:03,420
How lame.

131
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:08,360
You went through all of that trouble
just because of some Egyptian fairy tale?

132
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:11,660
