167
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,580
Whoa! Hey, you!

168
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,057
Did you see that, man?

169
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:01,140
She didn't even look at that card.

170
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,478
That's right, Joey.

171
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:06,091
Her Millennium necklace shows
her events before they occur.

172
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:10,060
So she knows everything that's
gonna happen before it happens.

173
