I had those two cards in my hand.

185
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,720
Unless, of course, she's cheating.

186
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,260
Enough trickery!

187
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,920
Show me your cards right now!

188
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:58,320
