played that magic card.

189
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:03,560
Time for you to discard Revival
Magic and Monster Reborn!

190
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:04,960
As you wish.

191
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:08,280
That ends my turn.

192
