Ah, I remember Isisoo's
dueling tactics all too well.

193
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:16,677
She may have defeated me
when I was a weak child,

194
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:20,080
But now she wouldn't
stand a chance against me.

195
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:25,980
