back into the pathetic fool I once was.

196
00:10:26,140 --> 00:10:26,970
He is wrong.

197
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:30,577
I know my brother's kind and gentle
spirit is in there somewhere,

198
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:32,460
and I will set him free.

199
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:37,740
I promise, in the name of the Tomb
Keepers, Merrick will be saved.

200
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:39,160
Listen, my brother.

201
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:43,720
Your brother has been getting in
my way, so he must be banished.

202
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:45,240
Say goodbye. Die!

203
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:50,590
Sister!

204
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:56,360
Let's see which is stronger.

205
00:10:56,580 --> 00:10:58,340
Your tricks or my skills?

206
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:02,600
Force Raider Attacker Keldo now!

207
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:09,457
Oh, well now, maybe your
future isn't so bright.

208
00:11:09,540 --> 00:11:12,397
Perhaps if you spent
less time predicting the

209
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:15,037
future and more time
focusing on your dueling,

210
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:15,950
you wouldn't be...

211
00:11:16,033 --> 00:11:16,863
losing.

212
00:11:16,946 --> 00:11:19,160
You still don't understand, do you?

213
00:11:19,380 --> 00:11:22,860
I am aware of every twist
and turn that will occur.

214
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:26,737
I know exactly what card you're
going to play before you do,

215
00:11:26,820 --> 00:11:28,938
and I know how you're going to lose.

216
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:32,220
I don't know what kind of
imbecile you think I am,

217
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:35,379
but your little mind games
won't work on me, Ishizu.

218
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:39,237
I have the perfect plan
with the magic card shrink

219
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:42,457
in my hand and the trap
crush card face down on

220
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:45,317
the field I'll be able
to completely devastate

221
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:49,600
Ishizu She won't know what
hit her until it's too late

222
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:52,417
I still think it's gonna be a tough duel

223
00:11:52,500 --> 00:11:55,857
Ishizu may be able to see
the future but Kaiba's

224
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:58,857
got an Egyptian god
card Now I'll place one

225
00:11:58,940 --> 00:12:02,460
more card face down on
the field and end my turn

226
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:06,117
Just as I expected.

227
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,480
This card will be needed later.

228
00:12:09,300 --> 00:12:11,480
She'll never expect my next move.

229
00:12:11,860 --> 00:12:16,580
I'll destroy every powerful monster in
her deck using Shrink and Crush card.

230
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:20,440
Now I summon Mudora.

231
00:12:23,020 --> 00:12:26,457
I am left with no choice
but to call upon the powers

232
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:29,717
of my Millennium Necklace
to ensure my victory.

233
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:32,837
And it shows me that
Kaiba will attempt to win

234
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:36,160
this duel using the Egyptian
god card I gave to him.

235
00:12:36,420 --> 00:12:40,520
However, Obelisk will fall by
my hand, causing Kaiba's defeat.

236
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:45,700
And his loss shall be my gain as I move
closer to rescuing my dear brother.

237
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,440
What's the hold-up?

238
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,940
Patience, Kaiba.

239
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:54,093
I used up my patience waiting
for you to show up tonight.

240
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:55,520
Now go already!

241
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:59,487
The less I have to hear about
your insane brother, the better!

242
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:02,040
How dare you insult my family.

243
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:04,020
You'll regret those words.

244
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:08,437
